  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the grimy shadows of the Dia De Los Drinks dive bar, 'Stitches' witnessed enough back-alley deals and broken pool cues to last several lifetimes. He learned to survive by his wits and a knack for fixing things, a skill that proved invaluable after the Great Liquidity Crash when Subchain City became a free-for-all.",
    "class": "Tinkerer Enforcer",
    "name": "Stitches",
    "personality": "Cynical but resourceful. Stitches has seen the worst of Subchain City and expects nothing good to come his way, making him pragmatic and cautious. He's fiercely loyal to those who earn his trust, a rare commodity in the wasteland, and has a dark sense of humor that gets him through the bleakest of times.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Chrono-Cryo Overload: Stitches can overcharge his Chrono Hide Cryo backpack, freezing enemies in a small radius while temporarily boosting his own speed and attack with Beak Breakers. This is a risky maneuver due to the instability of the tech but it is effective for crowd control or escaping bad situations.",
      "name": "Chrono-Cryo Overload"
